  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">🇺🇸<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>RIWI® – Affiliate Program (USA)</strong></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">RIWI® is a premium play brand offering high-quality, ultra-durable foam building blocks designed to spark creativity, movement, and open-ended play for kids. What makes us different is our unique combination of safety-certified materials, modern colors, and modular designs that inspire endless fun and learning.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">As a RIWI® affiliate, you can earn<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>10% commission on every referred sale</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>through your personal link or coupon code. You’ll have complete creative freedom to promote RIWI® on TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, or anywhere your community is active.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Creators who join us get strong brand support, shareable assets, and the opportunity to be featured across our official channels.<br>If you love creating playful, family-focused, or lifestyle content, RIWI® is the perfect brand to partner with.</p></div></div>",
